<title>USA: AMEX list Roslyn Bancorp options.</title>
<headline>AMEX list Roslyn Bancorp options.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Monday it would list Roslyn Bancorp Inc options on April 21.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options would have opening strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2, with initial expirations in May, June, July and October.</p>
<p>Position limits of 10,500 contracts have been set.</p>
<p>AGS Specialist Partners has been named specialist.</p>
<p>The AMEX joins the Chicago Board Options Exchange and Pacific Exchange in listing Roslyn Bancorp options.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
